# Training environment dependencies (input for pip-compile).
# Reuses the production runtime lock so the training environment resolves the
# exact same versions of the shared pipeline libraries (scikit-learn, joblib,
# shap) as serving; parity is verified automatically by
# scripts/check_dependency_parity.py (see ADR-0017). pandas is pinned here
# explicitly for training (dtype coercion is ingestion/contract enforcement
# and never runs inside the serialized sklearn Pipeline); the runtime lock
# also resolves it transitively via shap, which serving uses for explanations.
-r requirements.txt
scikit-learn
joblib
pandas
